# Under the Skin: "Manifest dread. You may return a permanent card from your graveyard to your hand." (CR 701.62a, 608.2c). The manifest dread is
# done first, so the card it put into the graveyard is among the cards to choose from: Snapcaster Mage is manifested, the Island is milled, and the
# Island (a permanent card, CR 110.4a) is returned to the hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Under the Skin
Island x3
Snapcaster Mage
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Under the Skin.Cast
Bot1.Arrange(Snapcaster Mage | Island)
Bot1.Choose(Island)
? Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Snapcaster Mage

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Under the Skin
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
